  <data key="d0">agenda_item</data>
  <data key="d1">Item E-1</data>
  <data key="d15">E-1</data>
  <data key="d10">An Ordinance of the City Commission amending the Cocoplum Phase 1 Security Guard District, as created by Miami-Dade County pursuant to County Ordinance 95-214, to expand the scope of services to include additional security measures including but not limited to security cameras.</data>
